  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -IR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Past participle: cumplido (regular)",
    "*Cumplir años* = to have a birthday / to turn (an age): *Mañana cumplo 30 años* = Tomorrow I turn 30",
    "*Cumplir con* = to fulfil / to meet (an obligation): *Cumplió con su promesa* = He kept his promise",
    "*Cumplir una condena* = to serve a sentence",
    "*¡Feliz cumpleaños!* = Happy birthday! (from *cumpleaños* = birthday, lit. \"fulfil years\")",
    "Related: el cumpleaños (birthday), el cumplimiento (fulfilment/compliance), cumplido/a (fulfilled; also: compliment)"
  ],
